cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use rustcpd in your research, please cite it."
title: "rustcpd: Coherent Point Drift point-set registration in Rust"
abstract: >-
  A fast, deterministic Rust implementation of Coherent Point Drift
  point-set registration (rigid, affine, deformable, constrained
  deformable, and statistical-shape-model / atlas), with Python bindings
  and calibrated shape-completion uncertainty.
type: software
authors:
